'''Mistletoe''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2022 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]].  It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh. It has a green body with green holly leaves with red berries, hence the name. The guard is dark green and the handle is black. 

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Mistletoe (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

